Package: vectorvolt
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: WorkerRuntime <hello@workerruntime.com>
Homepage: https://workerruntime.com
Description: VectorVolt — ultra-low-latency kernel-bypass data engine
 VectorVolt is a zero-GC, kernel-bypass Write-Ahead Log and storage
 engine designed for sub-microsecond latency workloads. Includes
 vvctl, the VectorVolt control plane CLI.
Section: database
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
